From: ahmed asif rashid <asif.rashid@carrybee.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:03:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Carrybee complete design across all nine pages

Remove the old layout CSS (globals, demo, design-v3, trk-demo) and dead components.
Link cw.css and cw-live.css as the only stylesheets.
Port Admin & masters and the KAM/MX form to the demo layout (live logic unchanged).
Restyle login (lg-*), drawer pills, bell, combo, copy, install box.
Analytics, HUB, Team and Sync rebuilt in the demo layout with live data only.
Titles and kickers match v4. Tests 108/108; next build --webpack passes.
